# Quick requests against a local API (`make infra` + `make api`, or `make up`).
# Works with the VS Code REST Client extension, Visual Studio and JetBrains Rider.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Liveness: the process is running
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness: database, cache and storage are reachable
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Example use case
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/diagnostics/time
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only). Interactive docs: {{baseUrl}}/scalar
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
